 <h3><u>Allaho baqi min kulle fani</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Allah, allah, allah</p> 
  <p>Allah, allah, allah, allah..(2)</p> 
  <p>Ya maliko, ya khaliqo, ya batino, ya zahiro<br> ya qadiro, ya hakimo, ya momino, ya hadiyo<br> ya awwalo, ya akhiro, ya qaimo, al nafi'o<br> Allaho qabla kullo shay<br> Allaho ba'da kullo shay</p> 
  <p>Yeh kehke haider ne..(2)<br> Yeh kehke haider ne,<br> sajde mein rakhi peshani<br> Allaah...Allah<br> Allaho baqi min kulle faani..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Rab ka irada haider aur uski marzi bhi<br> iske haatho'n ne gundhi adam ki matti bhi<br> iske bacho'n ke naukar, jannat ke darzi bhi<br> ya rabbe zuljalal..(2)<br> har jumla haider ka..(2)<br> har jumla haider ka, is misre ka hai saani</p> 
  <p>2. Haatho'n se marna baa'nte, thokar se jeena bhi<br> marhab ke tukde karde, dharti ka seena bhi<br> khud hai manshoore yazdaa, uski kapina bhi<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> dawaa salooni ka..(2)<br> dawaa salooni ka, aur phir bhi baat ye maani</p> 
  <p>3. Khud hi qur'aan e natiq, aur khud hi qaari hai<br> iske haatho'n ki khilqat, ye duniya saari hai<br> fuzto be rabbil kaaba, ye hamd e baari hai<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> kehdi do lafzo mein..(2)<br> kehdi do lafzo mein, thi baat badi toolani</p> 
  <p>4. Chalta hai mera sikka arz o sama par<br> mai to rahunga zinda, hukme khuda par<br> mujhpe qaza gir jaye, ya mai qaza par<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> ye sunke haider se..(2)<br> ye sunke haider se, duniya ko hui hairani</p> 
  <p>5. Ek din nuseri bola, kyu mujhko maara hai<br> jo kuch aankho'n se dekha, maine wo bola hai<br> meri socho ka malik, iske hi jaisa hai<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> ye hamd e baari hai..(2)<br> ye hamd e baari hai, haider ki qasida khwani</p> 
  <p>6. Nafse khuda bhi haider, aur iska pehlu bhi<br> wo hai hijab e akbar, wird e allahu bhi<br> maana hai waliyo'n ne bhi, kehte hai sadhu bhi<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> samjha na koi isko..(2)<br> samjha na koi isko, baat hai ye irfani</p> 
  <p>7. Karbobala se pucho, is jumle ka matlab<br> sukhe kooze dikhlake, kehdenge tashna lab<br> besar laashe bolenge, ya phir bibi zainab<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> zere khanjar kehdega..(2)<br> zere khanjar kehdega, karbobala ka baani</p> 
  <p>8. Kulle eemaa'n ki baatein, eemaa'n hai mazhar<br> isme hai hami tera, irfan e haider<br> ye baatein karte hai hum, mimbar pe jaakar<br> ya rabbe zuljalaal..(2)<br> han ishq e haider ne..(2)<br> han ishq e haider ne, haider ki baat hai maani</p> 
  <p>Allaho baqi min kulle faani..(2)<br> ya rabbe zuljalal..(2)</p> 
